OL,6,     FThe series that looks at books,
OL,7,     Fplays and stories and how they
OL,8,     Fwork. John Yorke shows how Alice
OL,9,     FChildress's 1954 play has retained
OL,10,     Fits power and relevance.
OL,11,G1500 Trouble in Mind
OL,12,     FAlice Childress's seminal 1955
OL,13,     Fplay about simmering tensions in a
OL,14,     Frehearsal room. Contains language
OL,15,     Fwhich some may find offensive.
